 type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uganda-says-it-has-no-active-ebola-cases-but-infections-in-kenya-and-nigeria-are-prompting-fresh-scrutiny/a-79741580?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Health officials are investigating whether Ebola patients in Kenya and Nigeria crossed paths at Uganda's main airport as conflicting accounts cloud the source of one infection.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
